*****************************
***** HKS event display *****
*****************************
- evdisplay.C, evdisplay.h
- Developed on Oct. 2, 2026 by K. Nishida.
- Overlays recconstructed HKS track candiates from COIN ntuple (coinxxxx.root) on the HKS detector geometry.

root [0] .L compare_events.C 
root [1] evdisplay("coin76312.root",0,100) #run number, start event, # of events


